OL,3,GStrathclyde                            
OL,5,CToday:FAfter a dry start rain will     
OL,6,Fspread northeast later this morning,   
OL,7,Fbut Argyll remaining mainly dry. This  
OL,8,Fafternoon will be cloudy with spells   
OL,9,Fof rain.                               
OL,11,CTonight:FRain will clear away          
OL,12,Fnortheastwards this evening. Then the  
OL,13,Frest of the night will be mainly dry   
OL,14,Falthough a few showers across Argyll.  
OL,15,FFreshening winds in the west later.    
OL,17,CSunday:FAfter a dry start showery      
OL,18,Frain, briefly heavy, will spread east  
OL,19,Ffor a time in the morning. Bright in   
OL,20,Fthe afternoon with a few showers       
OL,21,Facross Argyll, dry elsewhere.          
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
