OL,3,GStrathclyde                            
OL,5,COutlook for Monday to Wednesday:FMild  
OL,6,Fand windy with rain on Monday. Early   
OL,7,Frain on Tuesday then bright and mainly 
OL,8,Fdry. Bright with showers on Wednesday. 
